1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,474
Video ya leo ni kuhusu nini?

2
00:00:03,475 --> 00:00:10,000
Ni muhtasari wa sarufi ya Kiwango cha N4.

3
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Mazungumzo ya Mahojiano / Mahojiano ya Kijapani

4
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:14,248
Samahani.

5
00:00:14,271 --> 00:00:17,104
Hujambo.

6
00:00:17,127 --> 00:00:19,361
Hujambo.

7
00:00:19,384 --> 00:00:22,453
Tafadhali kaa.

8
00:00:22,476 --> 00:00:24,469
Ndiyo.

9
00:00:24,492 --> 00:00:27,200
Asante sana.

10
00:00:27,224 --> 00:00:30,924
Ni mahojiano ya kazi ya muda mfupi, sivyo?

11
00:00:30,947 --> 00:00:34,290
Jina lako ni nani?

12
00:00:34,314 --> 00:00:37,014
Ninaitwa Yamada.

13
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:39,903
Nakutakia kazi njema.

14
00:00:39,926 --> 00:00:43,760
Yamada, je, wewe ni mwanafunzi?

15
00:00:43,783 --> 00:00:46,049
Ndiyo.

16
00:00:46,072 --> 00:00:49,455
Ndiyo, ni mwaka wa pili chuoni.

17
00:00:49,478 --> 00:00:51,978
Nimesikia.

18
00:00:52,001 --> 00:00:55,944
Jinsi unavyoendelea na somo la Kijapani?

19
00:00:55,967 --> 00:01:01,515
Kanji ni ngumu, lakini mazungumzo ni ya furaha.

20
00:01:01,539 --> 00:01:04,689
Ni nzuri sana!

21
00:01:04,713 --> 00:01:09,547
Yamada, unaweza kufanya kazi gani?

22
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:13,203
Ninaweza kupika.

23
00:01:13,226 --> 00:01:16,403
Pia ninaweza kuhudumia wateja.

24
00:01:16,426 --> 00:01:19,406
Unaweza kupika, basi?

25
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:23,100
Unaweza kupika vyakula gani?

26
00:01:23,123 --> 00:01:27,304
Ninaweza kupika kama karai na hambaga.

27
00:01:27,328 --> 00:01:29,697
Ni vizuri sana!

28
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:35,057
Duka hili ni busi sana mwishoni mwa wiki.

29
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:39,435
Je, unaweza kufanya kazi Jumamosi na Jumapili?

30
00:01:39,458 --> 00:01:43,159
Ninaweza kufanya kazi Jumamosi.

31
00:01:43,183 --> 00:01:47,299
Jumapili ni ngumu kidogo.

32
00:01:47,323 --> 00:01:49,489
Kwa nini?

33
00:01:49,512 --> 00:01:54,271
Jumapili nina masomo chuoni.

34
00:01:54,294 --> 00:01:56,794
Nimesikia.

35
00:01:56,817 --> 00:02:00,563
Jumamosi pekee ndio sawa.

36
00:02:00,587 --> 00:02:02,853
Asante sana.

37
00:02:02,876 --> 00:02:10,352
Yamada, wewe ni mtu mwenye furaha, na Kijapani chako ni kizuri sana, ni nzuri mno!

38
00:02:10,376 --> 00:02:13,143
Kweli?

39
00:02:13,166 --> 00:02:15,722
Ninashangilia!

40
00:02:15,745 --> 00:02:20,245
Tafadhali, fanya kazi na duka letu.

41
00:02:20,268 --> 00:02:22,336
Ndiyo.

42
00:02:22,359 --> 00:02:26,026
Nitapiga bidii sana.

43
00:02:26,049 --> 00:02:31,207
Duka lipo karibu na kituo cha treni, ni rahisi sana.

44
00:02:31,230 --> 00:02:33,064
Ndiyo.

45
00:02:33,087 --> 00:02:35,767
Ninajua vizuri.

46
00:02:35,790 --> 00:02:39,660
Uniformu nitakupa kesho.

47
00:02:39,683 --> 00:02:42,117
Nimeelewa.

48
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:46,276
Kesho utakuja saa ngapi?

49
00:02:46,299 --> 00:02:49,399
Ninaweza kuja saa tisa mchana.

50
00:02:49,422 --> 00:02:52,800
Basi, tunakutarajia.

51
00:02:52,824 --> 00:02:54,758
Ndiyo.

52
00:02:54,781 --> 00:02:57,881
Nakutakia kazi njema.

53
00:03:05,241 --> 00:03:06,741
Sehemu ya 2: Chagua na Jaribu Nguo / Kuchagua na Kujaribu Nguo

54
00:03:06,741 --> 00:03:11,607
Samahani, naweza kutazama kidogo?

55
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:14,863
Ndiyo, karibu.

56
00:03:14,886 --> 00:03:17,834
Tafadhali, angalia.

57
00:03:17,858 --> 00:03:23,091
Sweta hii inaonekana kuwa na joto sana.

58
00:03:23,114 --> 00:03:28,951
Ndiyo, hiyo ni sweta mpya ya mwaka huu wa baridi.

59
00:03:28,975 --> 00:03:32,309
Rangi pia ni nzuri sana, sivyo?

60
00:03:32,332 --> 00:03:36,965
Ndiyo, inapendwa sana.

61
00:03:36,988 --> 00:03:40,688
Naweza kujaribu hii?

62
00:03:40,711 --> 00:03:43,744
Ndiyo, bila shaka.

63
00:03:43,767 --> 00:03:46,700
Kioo kiko huko.

64
00:03:46,723 --> 00:03:49,062
Asante sana.

65
00:03:49,086 --> 00:03:51,962
Inakuwaje?

66
00:03:51,985 --> 00:03:54,656
Inakufaa?

67
00:03:54,679 --> 00:03:59,346
Ndiyo, inakufaa sana.

68
00:03:59,369 --> 00:04:03,469
Lakini inaonekana kidogo kubwa.

69
00:04:03,492 --> 00:04:06,128
Nimesikia.

70
00:04:06,151 --> 00:04:10,784
Tuna saizi ndogo zaidi pia.

71
00:04:10,807 --> 00:04:15,241
Basi, nitaijaribu saizi ndogo.

72
00:04:15,264 --> 00:04:18,437
Subiri kidogo.

73
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:21,206
Umesubiriwa.

74
00:04:21,230 --> 00:04:23,930
Hii ndiyo.

75
00:04:23,953 --> 00:04:26,323
Asante sana.

76
00:04:26,346 --> 00:04:30,500
Aa, hii inafaa vizuri.

77
00:04:30,524 --> 00:04:33,862
Inaonekana kuwa na joto sana, sivyo?

78
00:04:33,885 --> 00:04:40,159
Ndiyo, ni nyepesi na rahisi kuvaa.

79
00:04:40,183 --> 00:04:43,533
Je, ungependa kuangalia rangi nyingine?

80
00:04:43,556 --> 00:04:47,232
Una rangi zipi nyingine?

81
00:04:47,255 --> 00:04:50,769
Tuna nyekundu na buluu.

82
00:04:50,793 --> 00:04:54,426
Sweta ya buluu pia inaonekana nzuri.

83
00:04:54,449 --> 00:04:58,920
Ndiyo, buluu inapendwa sana.

84
00:04:58,944 --> 00:05:02,922
Hmm, nafanya shauri gani.

85
00:05:02,945 --> 00:05:06,245
Ni ipi inafaa zaidi?

86
00:05:06,268 --> 00:05:10,735
Je, unavaa nguo nyeupe sana?

87
00:05:10,758 --> 00:05:15,424
Ndiyo, mara nyingi huvaa nyeupe.

88
00:05:15,447 --> 00:05:21,481
Kwa hiyo, sweta ya buluu itakufaa zaidi.

89
00:05:21,504 --> 00:05:23,453
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

90
00:05:23,477 --> 00:05:27,818
Basi, nitaichukua sweta ya buluu.

91
00:05:27,841 --> 00:05:30,010
Asante sana.

92
00:05:30,034 --> 00:05:32,967
Tafadhali nenda kwenye kasha.

93
00:05:32,990 --> 00:05:34,490
Sehemu ya 3: Majadiliano ya Zawadi ya Siku ya Kuzaliwa

94
00:05:34,490 --> 00:05:39,557
Siku ya kuzaliwa ya Suzuki inakaribia, sivyo?

95
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:42,365
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

96
00:05:42,388 --> 00:05:46,066
Itafika Ijumaa ya wiki ijayo.

97
00:05:46,090 --> 00:05:50,190
Tunapaswa kumletea zawadi, sivyo?

98
00:05:50,213 --> 00:05:52,747
Ni vizuri sana!

99
00:05:52,770 --> 00:05:56,203
Tumletee nini?

100
00:05:56,226 --> 00:06:00,659
Suzuki anachotaka nini?

101
00:06:00,682 --> 00:06:04,827
Hmm, sijui kabisa.

102
00:06:04,851 --> 00:06:09,485
Mwaka jana ulimletea nini kwa siku yake ya kuzaliwa?

103
00:06:09,508 --> 00:06:13,608
Mwaka jana nilimletea kitabu.

104
00:06:13,630 --> 00:06:17,184
Mimi nilimletea vyakula vitamu.

105
00:06:17,208 --> 00:06:23,647
Mwaka huu tuwaletee pamoja kitu fulani?

106
00:06:23,670 --> 00:06:28,104
Suzuki anapenda kahawa, sivyo?

107
00:06:28,127 --> 00:06:32,478
Ndiyo, hunywa kila siku.

108
00:06:32,501 --> 00:06:37,034
Je, kikombe cha kahawa kitamfaa?

109
00:06:37,057 --> 00:06:39,625
Ni vizuri sana!

110
00:06:39,649 --> 00:06:43,558
Tumletee pia mbegu za kahawa.

111
00:06:43,581 --> 00:06:46,820
Nina hakika atafurahi sana.

112
00:06:46,843 --> 00:06:49,910
Tunauze wapi?

113
00:06:49,933 --> 00:06:54,599
Kuna duka jipya mbele ya kituo cha treni.

114
00:06:54,622 --> 00:06:58,756
Basi, tutaenda huko kesho.

115
00:06:58,779 --> 00:07:04,316
Kwa kweli, Suzuki anapenda rangi nyekundu, sivyo?

116
00:07:04,339 --> 00:07:08,972
Ndiyo, nina gari jekundu.

117
00:07:08,995 --> 00:07:13,303
Basi, tutafute kikombe chekundu.

118
00:07:13,326 --> 00:07:15,364
Ni vizuri sana!

119
00:07:15,388 --> 00:07:21,888
Aa, nitamfanya Suzuki keki wiki ijayo.

120
00:07:21,911 --> 00:07:25,177
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

121
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:28,267
Ninapenda nikala pia.

122
00:07:28,290 --> 00:07:33,190
Basi, nitakufanya keki siku ya kuzaliwa kwako pia.

123
00:07:33,213 --> 00:07:35,756
Kweli?

124
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:38,685
Ninasubiri kwa hamu.

125
00:07:38,708 --> 00:07:44,375
Siku ya kuzaliwa ya Suzuki, tutafanya sherehe pamoja.

126
00:07:44,398 --> 00:07:49,264
Ndiyo, nitahifadhi mgahawa tayari.

127
00:07:49,287 --> 00:07:52,042
Nakutakia kazi njema.

128
00:07:52,066 --> 00:07:56,299
Hakika itakuwa sherehe ya furaha.

129
00:07:56,322 --> 00:07:57,822
Sehemu ya 4: Mpango wa Safari: Bahari au Onsen? / Mpango wa Safari: Bahari au Chemchem za Moto?

130
00:07:57,822 --> 00:08:03,155
Wiki ijayo, je, twende safari pamoja?

131
00:08:03,178 --> 00:08:06,153
Ni vizuri sana!

132
00:08:06,177 --> 00:08:09,128
Tutakwenda wapi?

133
00:08:09,152 --> 00:08:13,652
Ninapenda kwenda baharini.

134
00:08:13,675 --> 00:08:16,309
Bahari?

135
00:08:16,332 --> 00:08:21,637
Lakini, wikiendi huenda mvua itanyesha.

136
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:23,693
Eh?

137
00:08:23,716 --> 00:08:26,216
Kweli?

138
00:08:26,239 --> 00:08:30,575
Ndiyo. Walisema katika habari za hali ya hewa.

139
00:08:30,599 --> 00:08:34,106
Hiyo ni vibaya.

140
00:08:34,130 --> 00:08:39,630
Kwa sababu mvua huenda itanyesha, je, twende onsen?

141
00:08:39,653 --> 00:08:44,847
Onsen? Wazo zuri!

142
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:49,581
Onsen, hata kama mvua itanyesha, tunaweza kuingia.

143
00:08:49,605 --> 00:08:53,723
Onsen gani itakuwa nzuri?

144
00:08:53,746 --> 00:08:56,459
Hakone je, unaona?

145
00:08:56,482 --> 00:08:59,516
Iko karibu na Tokyo.

146
00:08:59,539 --> 00:09:02,873
Hakone ni nzuri.

147
00:09:02,896 --> 00:09:06,597
Ninapenda kula chakula kitamu pia.

148
00:09:06,621 --> 00:09:10,888
Basi, je, tuhifadhi ryokan?

149
00:09:10,911 --> 00:09:13,623
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

150
00:09:13,646 --> 00:09:16,951
Unapenda ryokan ya aina gani?

151
00:09:16,975 --> 00:09:21,054
Ninapenda ryokan yenye ofuro ya nje.

152
00:09:21,077 --> 00:09:25,510
Nimeelewa. Nitatafuta.

153
00:09:25,533 --> 00:09:28,900
Tutakwenda kwa gari?

154
00:09:28,924 --> 00:09:31,624
Je, tutakwenda kwa treni?

155
00:09:31,647 --> 00:09:35,083
Je, ni vizuri tukwende kwa treni?

156
00:09:35,106 --> 00:09:37,840
Kwa nini?

157
00:09:37,863 --> 00:09:42,696
Kwa sababu barabara huenda zikashika wikiendi.

158
00:09:42,719 --> 00:09:47,905
Nimeelewa. Treni, tutaweza kujua saa.

159
00:09:47,929 --> 00:09:52,595
Ndiyo. Tutununue chakula cha mchana kwenye stesheni.

160
00:09:52,618 --> 00:09:55,561
Inaonekana ya furaha.

161
00:09:55,585 --> 00:09:59,343
Je, tutamwalika nani zaidi?

162
00:09:59,367 --> 00:10:03,201
Je, tuwalike Tanaka pia?

163
00:10:03,224 --> 00:10:06,357
Ni vizuri sana!

164
00:10:06,380 --> 00:10:09,480
Nitamuuliza kesho.

165
00:10:09,503 --> 00:10:12,736
Basi, naomba unisaidie.

166
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:16,693
Ndiyo. Nitakutumia ujumbe tena.

167
00:10:16,717 --> 00:10:18,217
Sehemu ya 5: Maandalizi ya Barbekyu / Maandalizi ya Choma

168
00:10:18,217 --> 00:10:22,883
Barbekyu ya wiki ijayo, ninasubiri kwa hamu!

169
00:10:22,906 --> 00:10:27,940
Ndiyo. Nina mpango wa kula sana.

170
00:10:27,963 --> 00:10:31,429
Maandalizi yatafanyika vipi?

171
00:10:31,452 --> 00:10:35,961
Mimi nitanunua nyama.

172
00:10:35,984 --> 00:10:38,418
Asante sana.

173
00:10:38,441 --> 00:10:44,022
Nina mpango wa kununua nyama ya ng'ombe na nguruwe kwa wingi.

174
00:10:44,046 --> 00:10:47,781
Tafadhali nunua na kuku pia.

175
00:10:47,804 --> 00:10:50,540
Sawa.

176
00:10:50,564 --> 00:10:53,698
Mboga je, tutafanyaje?

177
00:10:53,721 --> 00:10:58,072
Mimi nitakata mboga.

178
00:10:58,095 --> 00:11:00,664
Asante sana.

179
00:11:00,687 --> 00:11:03,759
Vinywaji pia tunahitaji.

180
00:11:03,783 --> 00:11:09,254
Nina mpango wa kwenda dukani kesho kununua vitu.

181
00:11:09,278 --> 00:11:14,178
Vitu ni vizito, nitakusaidia kwenda.

182
00:11:14,201 --> 00:11:16,377
Asante sana.

183
00:11:16,401 --> 00:11:20,467
Tununue bia na chai.

184
00:11:20,490 --> 00:11:22,791
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

185
00:11:22,814 --> 00:11:26,548
Je, una sahani na glasi?

186
00:11:26,570 --> 00:11:32,079
Nina hapa nyumbani, nitabeba nami.

187
00:11:32,103 --> 00:11:35,814
Tununue pia mifuko ya taka.

188
00:11:35,837 --> 00:11:39,371
Sawa, nitandika kumbukumbu.

189
00:11:39,394 --> 00:11:43,227
Hali ya hewa itakuwaje?

190
00:11:43,250 --> 00:11:46,366
Ninafikiri itakuwa jua.

191
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:50,057
Kama mvua itanyesha, tutafanya nini?

192
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:55,613
Kama mvua itanyesha, tutafanya sherehe nyumbani kwangu.

193
00:11:55,636 --> 00:11:58,628
Hiyo ni nzuri pia.

194
00:11:58,651 --> 00:12:02,584
Rafiki yetu Sato-san atakuja.

195
00:12:02,607 --> 00:12:07,480
Sato-san ana mpango wa kupiga gitaa.

196
00:12:07,504 --> 00:12:10,804
Hiyo itakuwa ya furaha.

197
00:12:10,827 --> 00:12:14,728
Mimi nitakamilisha kamera yangu.

198
00:12:14,752 --> 00:12:18,542
Tuchukue picha nyingi.

199
00:12:18,565 --> 00:12:23,338
Ndiyo. Natamani wiki ijayo iwe mapema.

200
00:12:23,362 --> 00:12:25,995
Kweli.

201
00:12:26,018 --> 00:12:29,122
Tujitahidi kuandaa kila kitu.

202
00:12:29,145 --> 00:12:32,845
Sawa, naomba utusaidie.

203
00:12:32,868 --> 00:12:34,368
Sehemu ya 6: Hali za Kutafuta Nyumba / Kutafuta Nyumba ya Kukodisha: Mahitaji Muhimu

204
00:12:34,368 --> 00:12:39,606
Samahani, ninatafuta nyumba.

205
00:12:39,629 --> 00:12:42,129
Karibu.

206
00:12:42,152 --> 00:12:46,023
Unatafuta nyumba ya aina gani?

207
00:12:46,047 --> 00:12:51,880
Ninapenda nyumba iliyo karibu na kituo cha treni na yenye utulivu.

208
00:12:51,903 --> 00:12:56,536
Unataka iwe umbali gani kutoka kituo cha treni kwa kutembea?

209
00:12:56,559 --> 00:13:03,026
Ninatafuta nyumba ambayo ni umbali wa dakika kumi au chini kwa kutembea kutoka kituo cha treni.

210
00:13:03,049 --> 00:13:05,919
Nimeelewa.

211
00:13:05,942 --> 00:13:10,076
Unataka nyumba yenye kodi ya kiasi gani?

212
00:13:10,099 --> 00:13:14,289
Ninapenda nyumba yenye kodi ya takribani elfu themanini.

213
00:13:14,312 --> 00:13:18,627
Nyumba hii inafaa?

214
00:13:18,651 --> 00:13:23,584
Hiyo ndiyo nyumba niliyoiona kwenye mtandao jana.

215
00:13:23,607 --> 00:13:26,041
Nimesikia.

216
00:13:26,064 --> 00:13:30,964
Ni umbali wa dakika tano kutoka kituo cha treni na ni rahisi sana.

217
00:13:30,987 --> 00:13:34,087
Je, nyumba ni pana?

218
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:36,508
Ndiyo.

219
00:13:36,531 --> 00:13:41,065
Ni nyumba yenye mwanga kwa sababu ina dirisha upande wa kusini.

220
00:13:41,088 --> 00:13:43,754
Ni vizuri sana!

221
00:13:43,777 --> 00:13:47,244
Je, naweza kuwa na wanyama wa kipenzi?

222
00:13:47,267 --> 00:13:50,059
Samahani.

223
00:13:50,083 --> 00:13:53,917
Watu wenye wanyama wa kipenzi hawawezi kukaa hapa.

224
00:13:53,940 --> 00:13:56,895
Nimesikia.

225
00:13:56,918 --> 00:14:00,700
Mimi nina paka.

226
00:14:00,724 --> 00:14:05,159
Ninahitaji nyumba ambapo watu wenye paka wanaweza kukaa.

227
00:14:05,182 --> 00:14:08,249
Subiri kidogo.

228
00:14:08,272 --> 00:14:10,544
Tafadhali.

229
00:14:10,567 --> 00:14:13,901
Chumba hiki kinaonekana vipi?

230
00:14:13,924 --> 00:14:17,690
Chumba kidogo kinaonekana kuwa cha zamani, sivyo?

231
00:14:17,713 --> 00:14:19,947
Ndiyo.

232
00:14:19,970 --> 00:14:24,603
Lakini tumekifanya marekebisho mapya!

233
00:14:24,626 --> 00:14:28,693
Kuna duka la bidhaa za jikoni karibu?

234
00:14:28,716 --> 00:14:30,982
Ndiyo.

235
00:14:31,005 --> 00:14:34,981
Kuna duka ambalo unaweza kwenda kwa miguu ndani ya dakika tatu.

236
00:14:35,005 --> 00:14:38,838
Hiyo ni rahisi sana!

237
00:14:38,861 --> 00:14:44,128
Mji huu ni wa kimya na salama, naomba ukaribu.

238
00:14:44,151 --> 00:14:48,895
Ningependa kuona chumba hiki mara moja.

239
00:14:48,918 --> 00:14:51,357
Nimeelewa.

240
00:14:51,381 --> 00:14:54,557
Unaweza kuja kuona sasa hivi?

241
00:14:54,581 --> 00:14:57,814
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

242
00:14:57,837 --> 00:15:01,670
Basi, nitakuelekeza kwa gari.

243
00:15:01,693 --> 00:15:04,393
Tafadhali njoo hapa.

244
00:15:04,416 --> 00:15:06,398
Ndiyo.

245
00:15:06,422 --> 00:15:09,055
Nakutakia kazi njema.

246
00:15:09,078 --> 00:15:12,664
Mizigo nitabeba mimi.

247
00:15:12,687 --> 00:15:16,060
Asante sana.

248
00:15:16,084 --> 00:15:17,584
Sehemu ya 7: Msaada wa Kuhamia na Kupika Kari

249
00:15:17,584 --> 00:15:23,936
Asante kwa kunisaidia kuhamia leo.

250
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:28,226
La, karibu sana.

251
00:15:28,249 --> 00:15:34,431
Nimepata msaada mkubwa kwa kubeba mizigo nzito.

252
00:15:34,455 --> 00:15:37,824
Usijali.

253
00:15:37,847 --> 00:15:41,354
Tumeshiba, sivyo?

254
00:15:41,378 --> 00:15:43,757
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

255
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:47,325
Tutakula kitu?

256
00:15:47,349 --> 00:15:52,782
Nitapika chakula cha mchana kwa ajili yako.

257
00:15:52,805 --> 00:15:55,342
Kweli?

258
00:15:55,365 --> 00:15:58,199
Ninashangilia!

259
00:15:58,222 --> 00:16:01,055
Kari itakuwa sawa?

260
00:16:01,078 --> 00:16:05,815
Ndiyo, napenda kari sana!

261
00:16:05,839 --> 00:16:10,379
Basi, subiri kidogo, tafadhali.

262
00:16:10,402 --> 00:16:12,318
Eeh?

263
00:16:12,342 --> 00:16:15,212
Kuna nini?

264
00:16:15,236 --> 00:16:19,988
Aa, nimeangusha sahani.

265
00:16:20,011 --> 00:16:22,920
Uko salama?

266
00:16:22,944 --> 00:16:25,977
Hujumbua?

267
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:29,633
Ndiyo, niko salama.

268
00:16:29,656 --> 00:16:34,690
Samahani kwa kuvunja sahani.

269
00:16:34,713 --> 00:16:37,813
Usijali.

270
00:16:37,836 --> 00:16:41,408
Nitakusafisha mimi.

271
00:16:41,431 --> 00:16:45,982
Asante, samahani.

272
00:16:46,006 --> 00:16:50,872
Jihadhari usikatwe mkono, tafadhali.

273
00:16:50,895 --> 00:16:54,162
Ndiyo, nitajihadhari.

274
00:16:54,185 --> 00:16:57,318
Taka la taka liko wapi?

275
00:16:57,341 --> 00:17:01,241
Tupa kwenye sanduku hilo.

276
00:17:01,264 --> 00:17:03,964
Nimeelewa.

277
00:17:03,987 --> 00:17:07,157
Samahani sana.

278
00:17:07,180 --> 00:17:11,247
Ni heri hakuna aliyejeruhiwa.

279
00:17:11,271 --> 00:17:16,038
Wewe ni mpole sana, asante.

280
00:17:16,061 --> 00:17:19,370
Kuhama ni kazi ngumu, sivyo?

281
00:17:19,393 --> 00:17:26,583
Ndiyo. Lakini nimefurahi sana kwa kunisaidia.

282
00:17:26,607 --> 00:17:30,707
Ikiwa kuna kitu kingine, niambie.

283
00:17:30,730 --> 00:17:33,040
Asante sana.

284
00:17:33,063 --> 00:17:36,203
Kari imekamilika!

285
00:17:36,227 --> 00:17:40,160
Waa, inaonekana kuwa tamu sana!

286
00:17:40,183 --> 00:17:43,283
Tunashukuru.

287
00:17:43,306 --> 00:17:44,806
Sehemu ya 8: Utaratibu wa Kutolea Cheti za Kiwango

288
00:17:44,806 --> 00:17:47,309
Samahani.

289
00:17:47,333 --> 00:17:50,599
Naomba kidogo?

290
00:17:50,622 --> 00:17:54,656
Ndiyo, naomba?

291
00:17:54,679 --> 00:17:59,512
Naomba nitoe cheti cha alama zangu.

292
00:17:59,535 --> 00:18:02,168
Sawa.

293
00:18:02,191 --> 00:18:05,870
Tafadhali nionyeshe kitambulisho chako cha mwanafunzi.

294
00:18:05,894 --> 00:18:09,164
Ndiyo, hii ndiyo.

295
00:18:09,187 --> 00:18:11,520
Asante sana.

296
00:18:11,543 --> 00:18:14,453
Unahitaji karatasi ngapi?

297
00:18:14,477 --> 00:18:17,711
Nahitaji mbili tafadhali.

298
00:18:17,734 --> 00:18:20,167
Sawa.

299
00:18:20,190 --> 00:18:25,029
Tafadhali uandike jina lako kwenye karatasi hii.

300
00:18:25,052 --> 00:18:29,008
Ndiyo, nitaandika hapa.

301
00:18:29,032 --> 00:18:32,544
Hii inatosha?

302
00:18:32,568 --> 00:18:35,526
Ndiyo, sawa kabisa.

303
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:40,668
Samahani, nitapata cheti lini?

304
00:18:40,691 --> 00:18:43,885
Kutwa kesho mchana.

305
00:18:43,909 --> 00:18:46,542
Kesho?

306
00:18:46,565 --> 00:18:51,913
Ndiyo, kwa sababu leo mashine zimeharibika.

307
00:18:51,937 --> 00:18:56,709
Ningependa iwe tayari kesho asubuhi.

308
00:18:56,732 --> 00:18:59,365
Una haraka?

309
00:18:59,388 --> 00:19:05,055
Ndiyo, kesho nina usaili wa kazi ya muda.

310
00:19:05,078 --> 00:19:07,745
Nimesikia.

311
00:19:07,768 --> 00:19:12,203
Basi, nitakutoa leo jioni.

312
00:19:12,227 --> 00:19:14,893
Kweli?

313
00:19:14,916 --> 00:19:17,183
Asante sana.

314
00:19:17,206 --> 00:19:20,673
Rudi tena saa kumi na moja mchana.

315
00:19:20,696 --> 00:19:24,131
Ndiyo, nitakuja bila shaka.

316
00:19:24,154 --> 00:19:27,987
Ufanisi katika usaili wako!

317
00:19:28,010 --> 00:19:32,277
Ndiyo, ningependa nipate fursa hiyo.

318
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:35,408
Utafaulu bila shaka.

319
00:19:35,431 --> 00:19:39,864
Asante kwa kunisaidia vizuri.

320
00:19:39,887 --> 00:19:44,398
Karibu. Je, una swali lingine?

321
00:19:44,422 --> 00:19:47,727
Ndiyo, niko salama.

322
00:19:47,751 --> 00:19:51,584
Basi, nitakutariri saa kumi na moja.

323
00:19:51,607 --> 00:19:54,240
Samahani.

324
00:19:54,263 --> 00:19:55,763
Sehemu ya 9: Dukani ya mkate karibu na kituo cha treni itafungwa na jengo jipya

325
00:19:55,763 --> 00:20:02,030
Dukani ya mkate karibu na kituo cha treni, inatarajiwa kufungwa mwezi ujao.

326
00:20:02,053 --> 00:20:05,953
Aa, kweli?

327
00:20:05,976 --> 00:20:10,885
Ndiyo, Bwana Tanaka alisema hivyo.

328
00:20:10,908 --> 00:20:14,411
Hiyo ni vibaya.

329
00:20:14,435 --> 00:20:19,004
Mkate wao ulikuwa mnono sana.

330
00:20:19,028 --> 00:20:23,340
Mmiliki wa duka ameugua.

331
00:20:23,363 --> 00:20:26,297
Kweli?

332
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:29,455
Ni wasiwasi sana.

333
00:20:29,478 --> 00:20:35,411
Karibu na duka la mkate, jengo jipya litajengwa.

334
00:20:35,434 --> 00:20:39,970
Haya. Ni jengo la aina gani?

335
00:20:39,994 --> 00:20:44,461
Kama kituo kikubwa cha ununuzi.

336
00:20:44,484 --> 00:20:48,117
Hiyo itakuwa rahisi sana.

337
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:53,174
Ndiyo, nimesikia hata ukumbi wa sinema utajengwa.

338
00:20:53,197 --> 00:20:56,230
Ukumbi wa sinema?

339
00:20:56,253 --> 00:20:58,886
Ni vizuri sana!

340
00:20:58,909 --> 00:21:03,776
Nitakuwa na maduka mengi ya nguo pia.

341
00:21:03,799 --> 00:21:07,510
Ununuzi utakuwa wa furaha zaidi.

342
00:21:07,534 --> 00:21:10,605
Litakamilika lini?

343
00:21:10,628 --> 00:21:14,544
Inatarajiwa kukamilika msimu wa machipuo wa mwaka ujao.

344
00:21:14,568 --> 00:21:17,936
Ningependa liwe tayari mapema.

345
00:21:17,959 --> 00:21:24,352
Kwa kweli, Suzuki anatarajiwa kuoa.

346
00:21:24,376 --> 00:21:28,109
Aa! Na nani?

347
00:21:28,132 --> 00:21:32,965
Anasema ataoa mtu wa ofisini.

348
00:21:32,988 --> 00:21:36,266
Hiyo ni ajabu!

349
00:21:36,290 --> 00:21:41,057
Inatarajiwa kufanya harusi mwezi ujao.

350
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:44,913
Je, tutakaribishwa?

351
00:21:44,936 --> 00:21:49,169
Hapana uhakika.

352
00:21:49,192 --> 00:21:54,059
Harusi itafanyika Hawaii.

353
00:21:54,082 --> 00:21:56,949
Hawaii?

354
00:21:56,972 --> 00:21:59,672
Ni vizuri sana!

355
00:21:59,695 --> 00:22:04,395
Ninapenda pia kwenda Hawaii.

356
00:22:04,418 --> 00:22:07,384
Inaonekana gharama nyingi zitahitajiwa.

357
00:22:07,407 --> 00:22:12,074
Ndiyo. Nitakua nikijitahidi kuweka akiba.

358
00:22:12,097 --> 00:22:16,130
Nitaanza pia kuweka akiba.

359
00:22:16,153 --> 00:22:17,653
Mwonekano wa 10: Maelezo ya Sheria za Nyumba ya Pamoja

360
00:22:17,653 --> 00:22:21,720
Kuanzia leo, naomba tupatane vizuri.

361
00:22:21,743 --> 00:22:24,720
Nakutakia kazi njema.

362
00:22:24,743 --> 00:22:29,656
Nitakueleza sheria za nyumba ya pamoja.

363
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:32,676
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

364
00:22:32,700 --> 00:22:37,018
Kwanza, ni juu ya jinsi ya kutupa taka.

365
00:22:37,042 --> 00:22:41,108
Je, si lazima kutenganisha taka?

366
00:22:41,131 --> 00:22:47,198
Hapana. Lazima kutenganisha taka kabla ya kutupa.

367
00:22:47,221 --> 00:22:49,937
Nimeelewa.

368
00:22:49,961 --> 00:22:55,150
Taka zinazowaka ni Jumatatu na Alhamisi.

369
00:22:55,174 --> 00:22:58,713
Taka zisizowaka ni lini?

370
00:22:58,736 --> 00:23:03,508
Taka zisizowaka ni Ijumaa.

371
00:23:03,532 --> 00:23:06,965
Sawa, nitakumbuka.

372
00:23:06,988 --> 00:23:11,422
Baadae, ni juu ya jinsi ya kutumia bafu.

373
00:23:11,445 --> 00:23:15,401
Je, naweza kuingia bafuni wakati wowote?

374
00:23:15,424 --> 00:23:21,137
Usiingie bafuni baada ya saa sita usiku.

375
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:23,669
Kwa nini?

376
00:23:23,693 --> 00:23:30,126
Kwa sababu ni kelele. Ingia kabla ya watu kulala.

377
00:23:30,149 --> 00:23:32,663
Nimeelewa.

378
00:23:32,687 --> 00:23:35,285
Nitakuwa makini.

379
00:23:35,309 --> 00:23:39,675
Kisha, ni kuhusu mashine ya kufua.

380
00:23:39,698 --> 00:23:41,465
Ndiyo.

381
00:23:41,488 --> 00:23:48,234
Kabla ya kutumia mashine ya kufua, angalia mifuko yako.

382
00:23:48,257 --> 00:23:50,524
Nimeelewa.

383
00:23:50,547 --> 00:23:54,848
Usifue nguo usiku wa manane.

384
00:23:54,872 --> 00:23:57,871
Fanya kazi hiyo mwishoni mwa wiki.

385
00:23:57,894 --> 00:24:02,160
Sawa. Nitafua nguo mwishoni mwa wiki.

386
00:24:02,183 --> 00:24:06,518
Mwishowe, ni juu ya sheria za jikoni.

387
00:24:06,542 --> 00:24:10,175
Je, naweza kupika chakula?

388
00:24:10,198 --> 00:24:13,103
Ndiyo, bila shaka.

389
00:24:13,126 --> 00:24:19,193
Lakini, baada ya kupika, hakikisha unaosafisha.

390
00:24:19,216 --> 00:24:22,949
Sawa. Nitaitumia vizuri na kuilinda safi.

391
00:24:22,972 --> 00:24:26,956
Sheria ni hizi tu.

392
00:24:26,979 --> 00:24:31,246
Asante kwa kunieleza kwa uangalifu.

393
00:24:31,269 --> 00:24:36,402
Kama una swali lolote, uliza wakati wowote.

394
00:24:36,425 --> 00:24:40,732
Sawa. Nitakuwa mkaribu.

395
00:24:40,756 --> 00:24:42,256
Mwonekano wa 11: Matatizo ya Vitu Vilivyusahau / Matatizo ya Vitu Uliyovikosa

396
00:24:42,256 --> 00:24:45,404
Umefanya nini?

397
00:24:45,427 --> 00:24:48,403
Huna nguvu leo.

398
00:24:48,427 --> 00:24:54,694
Kweli, nimesahau mfuko wangu ndani ya treni.

399
00:24:54,717 --> 00:24:58,877
Eeh! Hiyo ni mbaya sana.

400
00:24:58,900 --> 00:25:04,470
Nilikuwa nimechoka, nikalala ndani ya treni.

401
00:25:04,493 --> 00:25:08,264
Umelala kupita kiasi.

402
00:25:08,288 --> 00:25:14,254
Ndiyo, nilipofika kituo, nilishuka haraka.

403
00:25:14,277 --> 00:25:17,711
Mfuko ulikuwa wapi?

404
00:25:17,734 --> 00:25:22,000
Nilikuwa nimeuweka kwenye rafu ya treni.

405
00:25:22,023 --> 00:25:24,890
Rafu ya treni?

406
00:25:24,913 --> 00:25:32,060
Ndiyo, mara tu nilipo shuka, milango ilifunga.

407
00:25:32,083 --> 00:25:36,834
Aa, mfuko ulikuwa bado ndani ya treni.

408
00:25:36,858 --> 00:25:42,253
Ndiyo, ningekuwa sijauweka mfuko hapo.

409
00:25:42,277 --> 00:25:45,977
Umewambia afisa wa kituo?

410
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:50,792
Ndiyo, nilimwambia afisa wa kituo mara moja.

411
00:25:50,815 --> 00:25:54,328
Je, mfuko umepatikana?

412
00:25:54,352 --> 00:25:57,585
Bado sijapata.

413
00:25:57,608 --> 00:26:01,841
Kuna nini ndani ya mfuko wako?

414
00:26:01,864 --> 00:26:05,766
Kuna pochi na funguo.

415
00:26:05,790 --> 00:26:10,372
Hii ni tatizo kubwa kweli.

416
00:26:10,396 --> 00:26:15,029
Ndiyo, ningalikuwa na tahadhari zaidi.

417
00:26:15,052 --> 00:26:17,519
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

418
00:26:17,542 --> 00:26:23,493
Jana usiku nilikunywa pombe nyingi sana.

419
00:26:23,516 --> 00:26:26,616
Ulikunywa mno?

420
00:26:26,639 --> 00:26:31,346
Ndiyo, ndiyo maana sikuelekeza asubuhi.

421
00:26:31,369 --> 00:26:35,236
Ulikosa treni?

422
00:26:35,259 --> 00:26:39,326
Ndiyo, nilikimbia hadi kituo.

423
00:26:39,349 --> 00:26:43,386
Ungaliamka mapema zaidi.

424
00:26:43,409 --> 00:26:46,942
Nadhani hivyo pia.

425
00:26:46,965 --> 00:26:51,632
Mfuko wako upatikane mapema.

426
00:26:51,655 --> 00:26:54,763
Asante sana.

427
00:27:04,795 --> 00:27:06,295
Mchezo wa 12: Furahia Kupika Kari Pamoja

428
00:27:06,295 --> 00:27:10,995
Sasa tutaanza kupika pamoja.

429
00:27:11,018 --> 00:27:15,167
Sawa, tutapika nini?

430
00:27:15,190 --> 00:27:19,379
Leo tutapika kari.

431
00:27:19,402 --> 00:27:21,988
Ni vizuri sana!

432
00:27:22,011 --> 00:27:26,164
Nitasaidie nini?

433
00:27:26,187 --> 00:27:30,254
Basi, kata mboga.

434
00:27:30,277 --> 00:27:32,860
Nimeelewa.

435
00:27:32,883 --> 00:27:36,717
Karoti na kitunguu, ndiyo?

436
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:41,573
Ndiyo, mimi nitangulia kuchoma nyama.

437
00:27:41,596 --> 00:27:45,696
Tupike wakati tunasikiliza muziki?

438
00:27:45,719 --> 00:27:48,619
Ni vizuri sana!

439
00:27:48,642 --> 00:27:51,942
Chagua muziki unayopenda.

440
00:27:51,965 --> 00:27:55,665
Basi, nitatia jazz.

441
00:27:55,688 --> 00:28:00,488
Kupika wakati wa kusikiliza muziki ni furaha.

442
00:28:00,512 --> 00:28:04,945
Ndiyo, nimekwisha kata mboga.

443
00:28:04,968 --> 00:28:07,540
Asante sana.

444
00:28:07,564 --> 00:28:10,754
Weka ndani ya sufuria.

445
00:28:10,777 --> 00:28:14,644
Sawa, nitaweka ndani ya sufuria.

446
00:28:14,667 --> 00:28:18,819
Kisha uze maji na uchemshe.

447
00:28:18,843 --> 00:28:21,709
Utaichemsha kwa muda gani?

448
00:28:21,732 --> 00:28:24,966
Uchemshe kwa dakika ishirini hivi.

449
00:28:24,989 --> 00:28:27,222
Nimeelewa.

450
00:28:27,245 --> 00:28:32,547
Ikiwa utaweka hii, itakuwa ladha nzuri mara moja.

451
00:28:32,570 --> 00:28:35,239
Hii ni nini?

452
00:28:35,263 --> 00:28:38,059
Ni chokoleti.

453
00:28:38,082 --> 00:28:43,798
Eeh! Unataka kuweka chokoleti katika kari?

454
00:28:43,821 --> 00:28:50,354
Ndiyo, chokoleti huifanya ladha iwe tamu na laini.

455
00:28:50,377 --> 00:28:54,044
Haya, sijui hilo.

456
00:28:54,067 --> 00:28:57,256
Jaribu mara moja.

457
00:28:57,279 --> 00:29:02,795
Sawa, nitajaribu kuweka wakati nitakapopika mwenyewe.

458
00:29:02,819 --> 00:29:06,174
Harufu nzuri inaanza kuja.

459
00:29:06,197 --> 00:29:11,464
Ndiyo, naona nina njaa.

460
00:29:11,487 --> 00:29:14,587
Inakaribia kuwa tayari.

461
00:29:14,610 --> 00:29:17,727
Natumaini nitaipata mapema.

462
00:29:17,751 --> 00:29:19,251
Mchezo wa 13: Utaratibu wa Kuingia Kwenye Hoteli

463
00:29:19,251 --> 00:29:24,084
Samahani, ningependa kuingia.

464
00:29:24,107 --> 00:29:26,622
Karibu.

465
00:29:26,646 --> 00:29:30,579
Tafadhali nipe jina lako.

466
00:29:30,602 --> 00:29:32,983
Tanaka.

467
00:29:33,007 --> 00:29:35,707
Bwana Tanaka, ndiyo?

468
00:29:35,730 --> 00:29:38,830
Tumekulinda kwa ajili yako.

469
00:29:38,853 --> 00:29:42,237
Nimefanya bookingu kwa njia ya mtandao.

470
00:29:42,260 --> 00:29:44,896
Vema, nimekuelewa.

471
00:29:44,919 --> 00:29:47,753
Nitakuthibitisha.

472
00:29:47,776 --> 00:29:50,809
Samahani sana.

473
00:29:50,832 --> 00:29:55,165
Hatupati bookingu yako, Bwana Tanaka.

474
00:29:55,188 --> 00:30:01,455
Eeh! Nimefanya bookingu moja mwezi uliopita bila shaka.

475
00:30:01,478 --> 00:30:05,028
Uliweka bookingu lini?

476
00:30:05,051 --> 00:30:08,626
Tarehe tano Oktoba.

477
00:30:08,650 --> 00:30:12,521
Barua pepe ya uthibitisho inapaswa kuwa imefika.

478
00:30:12,544 --> 00:30:15,740
Nitatafuta tena.

479
00:30:15,764 --> 00:30:18,997
Subiri kidogo tafadhali.

480
00:30:19,020 --> 00:30:21,654
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

481
00:30:21,677 --> 00:30:24,543
Umechelewa kidogo.

482
00:30:24,566 --> 00:30:29,338
Tumethibitisha bookingu yako, Bwana Tanaka.

483
00:30:29,361 --> 00:30:32,634
Ah, asante Mungu.

484
00:30:32,658 --> 00:30:36,604
Samahani sana kwa makosa haya.

485
00:30:36,628 --> 00:30:39,961
Hapana, hakuna matata.

486
00:30:39,984 --> 00:30:45,217
Leo tumekupangia chumba chenye maoni ya bahari.

487
00:30:45,240 --> 00:30:48,107
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

488
00:30:48,130 --> 00:30:51,845
Nitabeba mizigo yako.

489
00:30:51,868 --> 00:30:54,172
Asante sana.

490
00:30:54,196 --> 00:30:57,862
Chumba chako kiko ghorofa ya kumi.

491
00:30:57,885 --> 00:31:00,952
Mkahawa uko ghorofa ipi?

492
00:31:00,975 --> 00:31:04,692
Mkahawa uko ghorofa la kwanza.

493
00:31:04,715 --> 00:31:08,382
Kifungua kinywa huanza saa ngapi?

494
00:31:08,405 --> 00:31:13,772
Kifungua kinywa kinaweza kuliwa kuanzia saa moja asubuhi hadi saa nne asubuhi.

495
00:31:13,795 --> 00:31:16,070
Nimeelewa.

496
00:31:16,094 --> 00:31:21,327
Tuna bafu kubwa pia, karibu uuitumie.

497
00:31:21,350 --> 00:31:24,683
Ndiyo, nitakwenda kuuona.

498
00:31:24,706 --> 00:31:28,810
Sasa, nitakuelekeza chumba chako.

499
00:31:28,834 --> 00:31:31,867
Nakutakia kazi njema.

500
00:31:31,890 --> 00:31:33,390
Sehemu ya 14: Shukrani na Maagano

501
00:31:33,390 --> 00:31:38,957
Rafiki, kesho tutakukosa sana.

502
00:31:38,980 --> 00:31:41,178
Ndiyo.

503
00:31:41,202 --> 00:31:46,268
Miaka mitatu imepita haraka mno.

504
00:31:46,291 --> 00:31:51,807
Asante sana kwa kunifundisha mambo mengi hadi sasa.

505
00:31:51,831 --> 00:31:56,210
Hapana, asante wewe.

506
00:31:56,234 --> 00:32:02,175
Nilifurahi sana wakati ulinisaidia nilipokuwa na makosa.

507
00:32:02,198 --> 00:32:06,465
Mwanzo mtu yeyote anaweza kukosea.

508
00:32:06,488 --> 00:32:11,389
Kwa sababu yako, kazi ilikuwa ya furaha.

509
00:32:11,412 --> 00:32:16,482
Nakushukuru kwa kunisema hivyo, ninafurahi sana.

510
00:32:16,506 --> 00:32:20,025
Endelea kufanya kazi vizuri katika kampuni mpya.

511
00:32:20,049 --> 00:32:22,183
Asante.

512
00:32:22,206 --> 00:32:25,439
Nina wasiwasi kidogo.

513
00:32:25,462 --> 00:32:29,605
Wewe utakuwa sawa bila shaka.

514
00:32:29,628 --> 00:32:33,007
Wewe pia endelea kufanya kazi vizuri.

515
00:32:33,030 --> 00:32:34,811
Ndiyo.

516
00:32:34,835 --> 00:32:37,935
Nitapiga bidii sana.

517
00:32:37,958 --> 00:32:42,912
Kama una maswali yoyote, wasiliana nami wakati wowote.

518
00:32:42,936 --> 00:32:45,302
Asante sana.

519
00:32:45,325 --> 00:32:47,693
Nitakutumia ujumbe.

520
00:32:47,717 --> 00:32:51,217
Usijitahidi mno.

521
00:32:51,240 --> 00:32:53,140
Ndiyo.

522
00:32:53,162 --> 00:32:55,629
Nitakuwa makini.

523
00:32:55,652 --> 00:32:59,359
Pumzika vizuri mara kwa mara.

524
00:32:59,383 --> 00:33:01,686
Ndiyo.

525
00:33:01,709 --> 00:33:06,243
Ninafikiri pia utachoka katika mazingira mapya.

526
00:33:06,266 --> 00:33:08,732
Ndiyo.

527
00:33:08,755 --> 00:33:13,259
Tunze afya yako katika mahali mapya.

528
00:33:13,282 --> 00:33:15,656
Asante.

529
00:33:15,679 --> 00:33:18,668
Afya ni muhimu zaidi.

530
00:33:18,691 --> 00:33:22,890
Tukutane tena siku moja tukakula pamoja.

531
00:33:22,913 --> 00:33:25,384
Ndiyo, bila shaka.

532
00:33:25,407 --> 00:33:27,347
Ndugu, nipeleke mwaliko.

533
00:33:27,371 --> 00:33:29,325
Ndiyo.

534
00:33:29,349 --> 00:33:31,894
Hakika nitakupeleka mwaliko.

535
00:33:31,917 --> 00:33:34,617
Haya, tutaonana tena.

536
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:36,718
Ndiyo.

537
00:33:36,742 --> 00:33:40,339
Asante sana kwa kila kitu hadi sasa.

538
00:33:40,362 --> 00:33:44,262
Nasi pia, asante sana kwako.

539
00:33:44,285 --> 00:33:46,619
Uwe na afya.

540
00:33:46,642 --> 00:33:50,542
Wewe pia uwe na afya. Kwa heri.

541
00:33:50,565 --> 00:33:52,065
Sehemu ya 15: Maamkizi na Mazungumzo ya Kwanza

542
00:33:52,065 --> 00:33:54,798
Samahani kwa kuingilia.

543
00:33:54,821 --> 00:33:57,321
Tumekulinda kwa ajili yako.

544
00:33:57,344 --> 00:34:00,343
Tafadhali ingia.

545
00:34:00,366 --> 00:34:04,738
Asante kwa kutuchukua muda wako mzuri leo.

546
00:34:04,762 --> 00:34:10,200
Hapana, asante wewe kwa kuja kutoka mbali.

547
00:34:10,223 --> 00:34:15,557
Ninaitwa Yamada kutoka Kampuni ya Mirai.

548
00:34:15,580 --> 00:34:19,246
Habari yako. Ninaitwa Sato.

549
00:34:19,269 --> 00:34:22,502
Tunashukuru kwa msaada wako daima.

550
00:34:22,525 --> 00:34:26,279
Nasi pia, tunashukuru kwa msaada wenu.

551
00:34:26,303 --> 00:34:28,858
Tafadhali kaa.

552
00:34:28,881 --> 00:34:31,514
Samahani kwa kuingilia.

553
00:34:31,537 --> 00:34:35,104
Ulikuja kwa treni leo?

554
00:34:35,127 --> 00:34:39,366
Ndiyo, niliwasili kwa Shinkansen.

555
00:34:39,389 --> 00:34:42,975
Sawa. Ulikuwa mbali, sivyo?

556
00:34:42,999 --> 00:34:46,981
Hapana, niliwasili kwa saa mbili hivi.

557
00:34:47,004 --> 00:34:49,904
Hiyo ni nzuri.

558
00:34:49,927 --> 00:34:54,723
Hii ni zawadi ndogo, tafadhali pokea.

559
00:34:54,747 --> 00:34:58,327
Asante kwa ukaribu wako.

560
00:34:58,350 --> 00:35:01,088
Hii ni nini?

561
00:35:01,112 --> 00:35:05,012
Ni kitindamlo kinachoitwa Tokyo Banana.

562
00:35:05,035 --> 00:35:08,735
Aa, nimeisikia.

563
00:35:08,758 --> 00:35:11,664
Ni kitindamlo maarufu sana.

564
00:35:11,687 --> 00:35:16,154
Ndiyo. Ni maarufu sana Tokyo.

565
00:35:16,177 --> 00:35:19,244
Tutakula pamoja na wafanyakazi wote.

566
00:35:19,267 --> 00:35:23,237
Tafadhali mkaile pamoja na wenzenu.

567
00:35:23,261 --> 00:35:25,627
Asante sana.

568
00:35:25,650 --> 00:35:31,205
Bila kupoteza wakati, naomba nikusanye kuhusu bidhaa mpya.

569
00:35:31,229 --> 00:35:34,381
Ndiyo, tafadhali.

570
00:35:34,404 --> 00:35:38,598
Tafadhali angalia hati hii.

571
00:35:38,622 --> 00:35:41,924
Ndiyo, nitaiangalia.

572
00:35:41,948 --> 00:35:46,720
Bidhaa hii ni rahisi sana kutumia.

573
00:35:46,743 --> 00:35:51,057
Nimeelewa. Muundo pia ni mzuri.

574
00:35:51,081 --> 00:35:53,314
Asante sana.

575
00:35:53,337 --> 00:35:57,171
Nitatazama kwa kidogo.

576
00:35:57,194 --> 00:35:58,694
Sehemu ya 16: Vipengele Muhimu vya Kuchagua Simu ya Mkono

577
00:35:58,694 --> 00:36:03,994
Ninapenda kununua simu mpya ya mkono.

578
00:36:04,017 --> 00:36:06,683
Ni vizuri sana!

579
00:36:06,706 --> 00:36:10,615
Ni simu ya aina gani inayofaa?

580
00:36:10,639 --> 00:36:16,672
Ninahisi nia ya kamera kuwa nzuri.

581
00:36:16,695 --> 00:36:22,528
Simu za siku hizi zote zina kamera nzuri.

582
00:36:22,551 --> 00:36:25,330
Nimesikia.

583
00:36:25,354 --> 00:36:29,520
Ukubwa wa simu unapaswa kuwa upi?

584
00:36:29,543 --> 00:36:34,810
Sipendi skrini ndogo kwa sababu ni vigumu kuona.

585
00:36:34,833 --> 00:36:38,867
Hivyo, skrini kubwa ni bora.

586
00:36:38,890 --> 00:36:44,063
Lakini ikiwa kubwa mno, ni vigumu kushika.

587
00:36:44,087 --> 00:36:46,856
Hiyo ni kweli.

588
00:36:46,879 --> 00:36:52,346
Ni bora uende dukani uishike kwa mikono yako mwenyewe.

589
00:36:52,369 --> 00:36:54,524
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

590
00:36:54,547 --> 00:36:58,614
Kwa sababu ninajua kama ni nzito au la.

591
00:36:58,637 --> 00:37:02,470
Unafikiri nini kuhusu kifaa hiki?

592
00:37:02,493 --> 00:37:06,599
Kifaa hiki ni maarufu sana.

593
00:37:06,623 --> 00:37:10,257
Je, ni rahisi kutumia?

594
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:14,513
Ndiyo, ni rahisi sana kutumia.

595
00:37:14,536 --> 00:37:19,403
Ni muhimu iwe rahisi kutumia hata kwa wanaoanza.

596
00:37:19,425 --> 00:37:24,601
Kama ni hivyo, hiki ndicho kinachopendekezwa zaidi.

597
00:37:24,624 --> 00:37:28,258
Je, betri inaendelea kwa muda mrefu?

598
00:37:28,281 --> 00:37:33,714
Ndiyo, unaweza kukitumia kwa siku nzima bila matatizo.

599
00:37:33,737 --> 00:37:37,697
Ninataka kujua kama ni ngumu kuvunja.

600
00:37:37,720 --> 00:37:42,387
Tunatumia glasi ambayo ni vigumu kuvunja hata ukitupwa.

601
00:37:42,410 --> 00:37:45,643
Hiyo ni raha kubwa.

602
00:37:45,666 --> 00:37:48,974
Unapendelea rangi gani?

603
00:37:48,998 --> 00:37:52,831
Nashindwa kati ya nyeupe na nyeusi.

604
00:37:52,854 --> 00:37:57,042
Mimi naona nyeusi ni nzuri zaidi.

605
00:37:57,066 --> 00:38:00,133
Basi, nitachukua nyeusi.

606
00:38:00,156 --> 00:38:04,989
Ni vyema kununua kifuniko pamoja nayo.

607
00:38:05,012 --> 00:38:06,979
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

608
00:38:07,002 --> 00:38:11,198
Nitafuta kifuniko ambacho hakitakubali uchafu kwa urahisi.

609
00:38:11,221 --> 00:38:16,121
Unapoenda kununua, nawezaje kukusaidia?

610
00:38:16,144 --> 00:38:19,811
Ndiyo, naomba sana.

611
00:38:19,834 --> 00:38:21,334
Sehemu ya 17: Matatizo kwenye gari la moshi lililojaa

612
00:38:21,334 --> 00:38:24,171
Habari za asubuhi.

613
00:38:24,194 --> 00:38:27,027
Habari za asubuhi.

614
00:38:27,050 --> 00:38:31,317
Uonekana umechoka sana.

615
00:38:31,340 --> 00:38:38,112
Ndiyo. Gari la moshi la asubuhi lilikuwa vigumu sana.

616
00:38:38,135 --> 00:38:40,925
Gari la moshi lililojaa?

617
00:38:40,949 --> 00:38:46,027
Ndiyo, kulikuwa na watu wengi kuliko kawaida.

618
00:38:46,051 --> 00:38:49,351
Hilo lilikuwa gumzo kubwa.

619
00:38:49,374 --> 00:38:55,253
Nilipigwa mguu wakati nilipo ndani ya gari la moshi.

620
00:38:55,276 --> 00:38:59,258
Aisee! Ulikuwa unaumwa, sivyo?

621
00:38:59,281 --> 00:39:03,453
Ndiyo, niliumwa sana.

622
00:39:03,476 --> 00:39:06,776
Je, alikukubalia?

623
00:39:06,799 --> 00:39:13,699
Hapana, kulikuwa na watu wengi na sikujua ni nani aliyenipiga.

624
00:39:13,722 --> 00:39:17,556
Hiyo ilikuwa bahati mbaya.

625
00:39:17,578 --> 00:39:20,770
Si hiyo tu.

626
00:39:20,794 --> 00:39:24,227
Bado kulikuwa na kitu kingine?

627
00:39:24,250 --> 00:39:29,725
Mlango ulikuwa ukifunga na mkoba wangu uliingia ndani.

628
00:39:29,749 --> 00:39:32,529
Mkoba wako?

629
00:39:32,552 --> 00:39:35,385
Je, ulikuwa salama?

630
00:39:35,408 --> 00:39:41,247
Niliwaona watu wote hadi tulipofika kituo kijacho.

631
00:39:41,271 --> 00:39:45,004
Watu walikuwa wanakuangalia, hivyo.

632
00:39:45,027 --> 00:39:50,260
Ndiyo, asubuhi hiyo ilikuwa mbaya kabisa.

633
00:39:50,283 --> 00:39:57,183
Mimi pia zamani nilipoteza pochi yangu kwa mwizi kwenye gari la moshi.

634
00:39:57,206 --> 00:40:01,782
Aisee! Umepoteza pochi yako?

635
00:40:01,805 --> 00:40:06,839
Ndiyo, nilipoteza nikilala.

636
00:40:06,862 --> 00:40:09,772
Hiyo ni ya kutisha.

637
00:40:09,795 --> 00:40:14,895
Ni vyema kuwa makini sana kwenye gari la moshi lililojaa.

638
00:40:14,918 --> 00:40:20,052
Ndiyo, sasa nitashika mkoba wangu vizuri.

639
00:40:20,075 --> 00:40:24,641
Ni vyema pia kupanda gari la moshi kidogo baadaye au mapema.

640
00:40:24,664 --> 00:40:26,939
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

641
00:40:26,963 --> 00:40:31,429
Kutoka kesho nitatoka nyumbani mapema kidogo.

642
00:40:31,452 --> 00:40:34,352
Hiyo ni wazo zuri.

643
00:40:34,375 --> 00:40:39,052
Leo napenda kurudi nyumbani mapema na kupumzika.

644
00:40:39,076 --> 00:40:41,743
Tafadhali fanya hivyo.

645
00:40:41,766 --> 00:40:44,666
Umechoka sana, asante.

646
00:40:44,689 --> 00:40:46,189
Mandhari ya 18: Maandalizi na Mapambo ya Chama

647
00:40:46,189 --> 00:40:50,656
Hatimae kesho ndio siku ya chama!

648
00:40:50,679 --> 00:40:53,146
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

649
00:40:53,169 --> 00:40:56,160
Ninangojea sana.

650
00:40:56,183 --> 00:41:00,250
Twendeni tukapambe chumba.

651
00:41:00,273 --> 00:41:02,106
Ndiyo.

652
00:41:02,129 --> 00:41:05,762
Tuanze na nini?

653
00:41:05,785 --> 00:41:10,652
Kuna maua yamepambwa mezani, sivyo?

654
00:41:10,675 --> 00:41:12,508
Ndiyo.

655
00:41:12,531 --> 00:41:15,705
N ilinunua jana.

656
00:41:15,728 --> 00:41:19,109
Yanapendeza sana!

657
00:41:19,133 --> 00:41:21,407
Asante sana.

658
00:41:21,430 --> 00:41:26,349
Ningependa chumba kiwe angavu zaidi.

659
00:41:26,373 --> 00:41:28,746
Nimeelewa.

660
00:41:28,770 --> 00:41:32,109
Nitawasha taa zote.

661
00:41:32,133 --> 00:41:36,833
Twapambe kuta kwa baluni.

662
00:41:36,856 --> 00:41:39,813
Unapenda baluni za aina gani?

663
00:41:39,836 --> 00:41:44,569
Ningependa baluni zenye rangi nyingi.

664
00:41:44,592 --> 00:41:51,026
Basi, nitavimba baluni za nyekundu, buluu na njano.

665
00:41:51,049 --> 00:41:53,515
Tafadhali.

666
00:41:53,538 --> 00:41:57,905
Mimi nitapachika picha kwenye kuta.

667
00:41:57,929 --> 00:42:01,429
Kuna posta pia zimepachikwa.

668
00:42:01,452 --> 00:42:04,038
Kweli.

669
00:42:04,061 --> 00:42:06,801
Inaonekana nzuri!

670
00:42:06,825 --> 00:42:10,292
Sauti ya muziki itakuwaje?

671
00:42:10,315 --> 00:42:14,252
Ningependa muziki wa furaha.

672
00:42:14,275 --> 00:42:19,024
Basi, tutaweka CD hii.

673
00:42:19,048 --> 00:42:22,414
Kiwango cha sauti kikoje?

674
00:42:22,437 --> 00:42:27,504
Tungeongeza sauti kidogo?

675
00:42:27,527 --> 00:42:34,304
Hapana, tutashindwa kusikia mazungumzo, punguza kidogo.

676
00:42:34,328 --> 00:42:36,961
Nimeelewa.

677
00:42:36,984 --> 00:42:40,094
Nitapunguza sauti.

678
00:42:40,117 --> 00:42:44,251
Vinywaji vimehifadhiwa baridi?

679
00:42:44,274 --> 00:42:46,574
Ndiyo.

680
00:42:46,597 --> 00:42:49,663
Zimewekwa kwenye friji.

681
00:42:49,686 --> 00:42:53,960
Sahani na glasi zimewekwa tayari?

682
00:42:53,983 --> 00:42:58,933
Ndiyo, zimepangwa kwenye rafu.

683
00:42:58,957 --> 00:43:02,457
Maandalizi yamekwisha sawasawa!

684
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:04,780
Ndiyo.

685
00:43:04,803 --> 00:43:08,574
Kesho kitakuwa cha furaha!

686
00:43:08,597 --> 00:43:10,097
Mandhari ya 19: Alama za Mtihani na Kukagua

687
00:43:10,097 --> 00:43:13,997
Takashi, njoo hapa kidogo.

688
00:43:14,020 --> 00:43:16,854
Nini mama?

689
00:43:16,877 --> 00:43:21,224
Nionyeshe matokeo ya mtihani wako wa leo.

690
00:43:21,247 --> 00:43:25,281
Eeh, baadaye nitakuonyesha.

691
00:43:25,304 --> 00:43:28,692
Onyesha sasa hivi!

692
00:43:28,715 --> 00:43:31,981
Sawa, hii ndiyo.

693
00:43:32,004 --> 00:43:35,717
Hii ni nini, alama hizi?

694
00:43:35,741 --> 00:43:38,913
Haya si alama thelathini?

695
00:43:38,936 --> 00:43:43,236
Lakini ilikuwa ngumu sana!

696
00:43:43,259 --> 00:43:47,596
Kwa sababu hujasomei kila siku.

697
00:43:47,620 --> 00:43:50,795
Kutoka kesho nitajitahidi.

698
00:43:50,819 --> 00:43:54,556
Kila siku unasema hivyo.

699
00:43:54,579 --> 00:43:59,526
Leo nina ahadi ya kucheza na marafiki.

700
00:43:59,549 --> 00:44:02,856
Huruhusiwi kwenda kucheza.

701
00:44:02,880 --> 00:44:06,276
Eeh, kwa nini?

702
00:44:06,299 --> 00:44:10,937
Maliza kazi yako ya nyumbani kwanza, ndipo uende.

703
00:44:10,960 --> 00:44:14,394
Nitafanya baada ya kurudi.

704
00:44:14,417 --> 00:44:16,373
Hapana.

705
00:44:16,397 --> 00:44:19,897
Fanya kazi ya nyumbani sasa hivi.

706
00:44:19,920 --> 00:44:22,787
Sawa.

707
00:44:22,810 --> 00:44:27,076
Lazima ujifunze zaidi.

708
00:44:27,099 --> 00:44:30,966
Usinifanye nisome tu.

709
00:44:30,989 --> 00:44:36,022
Ukipata alama nzuri, nitakununulia mchezo.

710
00:44:36,045 --> 00:44:38,356
Kweli?

711
00:44:38,380 --> 00:44:41,513
Nitakununulia bila shaka.

712
00:44:41,536 --> 00:44:47,503
Ndiyo. Ukipata zaidi ya themanini katika mtihani ujao.

713
00:44:47,526 --> 00:44:50,668
Sawa, nitafanya bidii.

714
00:44:50,691 --> 00:44:55,993
Kabla ya hapo, safisha chumba chako.

715
00:44:56,017 --> 00:45:00,283
Eeh, na kusafisha chumba pia?

716
00:45:00,306 --> 00:45:03,015
Ndiyo, ni lazima.

717
00:45:03,039 --> 00:45:07,391
Chumba chafu hakusaidi kukaza akili.

718
00:45:07,414 --> 00:45:11,548
Sawa, nitasafisha sasa hivi.

719
00:45:11,571 --> 00:45:14,726
Ukimaliza, niite.

720
00:45:14,749 --> 00:45:17,383
Haya.

721
00:45:17,406 --> 00:45:18,906
Mchezo wa Pili 20: Siku za Kazi Nyingi Zisizokuwa na Mwisho / Mateso ya Kila Siku ya Ziada ya Kazi

722
00:45:18,906 --> 00:45:23,063
Aa, leo pia nimechoka sana.

723
00:45:23,086 --> 00:45:25,860
Kweli.

724
00:45:25,883 --> 00:45:30,117
Hivi karibuni, ninafanya ziada ya kazi tu.

725
00:45:30,140 --> 00:45:34,077
Jana ulienda nyumbani saa ngapi?

726
00:45:34,100 --> 00:45:37,576
Saa tano usiku.

727
00:45:37,600 --> 00:45:41,953
Meneja alinifanya nikae hadi kuchelewa.

728
00:45:41,976 --> 00:45:45,730
Hilo lilikuwa gumzo kubwa.

729
00:45:45,753 --> 00:45:50,656
Alinilazimisha nirudie kuandika hati zote tena.

730
00:45:50,679 --> 00:45:54,394
Eeh, zote?

731
00:45:54,418 --> 00:45:59,085
Ndiyo, nimechoka kabisa.

732
00:45:59,108 --> 00:46:06,014
Kila siku ninafanya kazi hivi, mwili wangu hautasimama.

733
00:46:06,037 --> 00:46:11,072
Ndiyo, hata nikilala sana, uchovu hauondoki.

734
00:46:11,095 --> 00:46:14,329
Wikendi pia unafanya kazi?

735
00:46:14,352 --> 00:46:19,018
Jumapili ninakuja ofisini.

736
00:46:19,041 --> 00:46:22,584
Hakuna likizo hata kidogo?

737
00:46:22,607 --> 00:46:25,274
Ndiyo.

738
00:46:25,297 --> 00:46:28,730
Natamani nipumzike vizuri.

739
00:46:28,753 --> 00:46:34,312
Hata ukimkemea mkuu, hakuna mabadiliko.

740
00:46:34,336 --> 00:46:38,769
Ndiyo, nafikiri hata ukisema, hakuna faida.

741
00:46:38,792 --> 00:46:45,826
Mimi pia siku hizi ninapewa kazi nyingi mpya.

742
00:46:45,850 --> 00:46:48,528
Tunapata shida zote mbili.

743
00:46:48,551 --> 00:46:53,733
Mwezi ujao, nitakuwa naenda nyumbani saa za kawaida.

744
00:46:53,757 --> 00:46:57,590
Eeh, unaweza kweli kwenda nyumbani?

745
00:46:57,613 --> 00:47:04,164
Ndiyo, hata nikizidiwa na kazi, nitaheshimu muda wangu.

746
00:47:04,188 --> 00:47:07,621
Hiyo ni azma nzuri.

747
00:47:07,644 --> 00:47:12,439
Sijui maisha ya kila siku ya kazi tu.

748
00:47:12,463 --> 00:47:17,797
Mimi pia sasa nitaanza kukataa kazi.

749
00:47:17,820 --> 00:47:23,486
Ndiyo. Usipoweza, sema hapana.

750
00:47:23,509 --> 00:47:28,818
Ndiyo, afya yangu ni muhimu zaidi.

751
00:47:28,842 --> 00:47:33,175
Je, leo tutaondoka mapema?

752
00:47:33,198 --> 00:47:38,376
Ndiyo. Leo nitakuwa naenda nyumbani mapema.

753
00:47:38,400 --> 00:47:40,916
Umechoka sana, asante.

754
00:47:40,940 --> 00:47:43,933
Umechoka sana, asante.